<%= render(:partial => 'layouts/headermenu') %>

<div class="jumbotron in-ban service">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="ban-text">
			<div class="updates">Strategic Technology Leadership</div>
			<h1>Ruby on Rails Advisory Services</h1>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>

<div id="content" class="service-wrap">
	<section class="breadcrumb-wrap">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="row">
				<nav aria-label="breadcrumb" class="brd">
					<ol class="breadcrumb">
						<li class="breadcrumb-item"><%= link_to "Home", root_path %></li>
						<li class="breadcrumb-item"><%= link_to "Services", services_index_path %></li>
						<li class="breadcrumb-item active" aria-current="page">Advisory Services</li>
					</ol>
				</nav>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="row-am first-sec">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="row">
				<div class="main-heading wow fadeInDown animated" style="visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInDown;">
					<h1>Strategic Rails Advisory & Technology Leadership</h1>
				</div>
				<p>Make confident technology decisions with guidance from seasoned Rails experts who have led transformations at Fortune 500 companies and innovative startups. Our advisory services provide executive-level strategic planning, architecture reviews, technology roadmaps, and vendor assessments to ensure your Rails investments deliver maximum business value and competitive advantage.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="about-two-part">
				<div class="col-md-6 about-two-inner-left">
					<div class="both">
						<div class="about-left-img">
							<img src="<%= asset_path('ser1.png') %>" alt="Technology Strategy">
						</div>
						<div class="about-right-cont">
							<div class="about-title">Technology Strategy & Roadmaps</div>
							<p>Develop comprehensive technology roadmaps aligned with business objectives, ensuring Rails investments support growth and innovation.</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="col-md-6 about-two-inner-right">
					<div class="both">
						<div class="about-left-img">
							<img src="<%= asset_path('ser2.png') %>" alt="Architecture Review">
						</div>
						<div class="about-right-cont">
							<div class="about-title">Architecture Assessment & Review</div>
							<p>Comprehensive evaluation of existing Rails architecture, identifying risks, technical debt, and opportunities for improvement.</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="about-two-part">
				<div class="col-md-6 about-two-inner-left">
					<div class="both">
						<div class="about-left-img">
							<img src="<%= asset_path('ser3.png') %>" alt="CTO Advisory">
						</div>
						<div class="about-right-cont">
							<div class="about-title">Fractional CTO Services</div>
							<p>Part-time technology leadership for startups and growing companies needing strategic guidance without full-time executive commitment.</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="col-md-6 about-two-inner-right">
					<div class="both">
						<div class="about-left-img">
							<img src="<%= asset_path('ser4.png') %>" alt="Vendor Assessment">
						</div>
						<div class="about-right-cont">
							<div class="about-title">Vendor Selection & Due Diligence</div>
							<p>Expert evaluation of Rails development partners, agencies, and tools to ensure optimal vendor selection and contract terms.</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section id="about-us-second" class="service row-am">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="row">
				<div class="col-md-6 left all">
					<%= image_tag 'service-left.png', alt: "Advisory Services" %>
				</div>
				<div class="col-md-6 right">
					<div class="ser-title"><i class="icofont-brain-alt"></i>Our Advisory Focus Areas</div>
					<p>We provide strategic guidance informed by real-world experience leading Rails initiatives at scale, combining technical expertise with business acumen.</p>
					<ul>
						<li>Technology strategy and planning</li>
						<li>Technical architecture and scalability assessment</li>
						<li>Technology stack evaluation and selection</li>
						<li>Build vs. buy decision frameworks</li>
						<li>Development team structure and hiring strategy</li>
						<li>Technical debt assessment and remediation planning</li>
						<li>Security and compliance advisory</li>
						<li>Cloud migration and infrastructure strategy</li>
						<li>M&A technical due diligence</li>
						<li>Executive technology education and workshops</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="row-am service-new">
		<div class="container ser-new-inner">
			<div class="row">
				<div class="service-single">
					<div class="ser-title"><i class="icofont-chart-line-alt"></i>Business-Aligned Technology</div>
					<p>Ensure your Rails technology investments directly support business objectives, competitive positioning, and growth strategies with executive-level strategic planning.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="service-single">
					<div class="ser-title"><i class="icofont-badge"></i>Expert Validation</div>
					<p>Gain confidence in technology decisions with independent expert review of proposals, architectures, and vendor recommendations from seasoned professionals.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="service-single">
					<div class="ser-title"><i class="icofont-light-bulb"></i>Innovation Acceleration</div>
					<p>Identify opportunities to leverage emerging technologies, optimize development processes, and accelerate time-to-market through strategic technology leadership.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<%= render(:partial => 'layouts/sec8interestedblock') %>
</div>

<%= render(:partial => 'layouts/footerjsblock') %>
